        "In some cases a marginal difference can be found in reported figures due to rounding off calculations for change in volume between annual and quarterly National Accounts tables.\r\nCOICOP – Classification of individual consumption by purpose.",
        "Correction 2026-08-28: A correction of a minor error affecting the distribution of household consumption expenditure according to consumption purpose (COICOP) and durability has been published. The error affected the quarterly series for the years 2022-2024, but only year 2024 for the annual series. Total household consumption expenditure was not impacted."
